{"kind": "paragraph", "text": "A leaky faucet that drips at a rate of one drop per second can waste more than an estimated 3,000 gallons of water per year.", "category": "main", "reason": "main_content", "level": 2, "section_path": ["Did you know?"], "source_tag": "p", "source_type": "", "coords": "4,84.00,700.58,405.90,16.74;4,84.00,724.58,414.23,16.74", "warnings": [], "article_id": "article_17", "source_title": "article_17", "source_tei": "data\\articles\\extracted_grobid_tei\\article_17.grobid.tei.xml", "block_index": 5, "section_title": "Did you know?", "section_depth": 1, "word_count": 26, "text_characters": 124, "pages": [4]}
{"kind": "paragraph", "text": "Waste not © shutterstock.com Recycling 1 ton of paper saves 7,000 gallons of water, three cubic yards of landfill space, and 4,100 kilowatt-hours of electricity.", "category": "main", "reason": "main_content", "level": 2, "section_path": ["Did you know?"], "source_tag": "p", "source_type": "", "coords": "4,84.00,763.39,85.33,20.09;5,84.00,287.18,128.55,16.74;5,84.00,318.68,397.59,16.74;5,84.00,342.68,371.74,16.74;5,84.00,366.68,66.68,16.74", "warnings": [], "article_id": "article_17", "source_title": "article_17", "source_tei": "data\\articles\\extracted_grobid_tei\\article_17.grobid.tei.xml", "block_index": 6, "section_title": "Did you know?", "section_depth": 1, "word_count": 28, "text_characters": 161, "pages": [4, 5]}
{"kind": "paragraph", "text": "Reuse containers and reduce waste. The average child's school lunch generates 67 pounds of packaging waste over a year.", "category": "main", "reason": "main_content", "level": 2, "section_path": ["Did you know?"], "source_tag": "p", "source_type": "", "coords": "5,84.00,398.18,424.64,16.74;5,84.00,422.18,396.75,16.74", "warnings": [], "article_id": "article_17", "source_title": "article_17", "source_tei": "data\\articles\\extracted_grobid_tei\\article_17.grobid.tei.xml", "block_index": 7, "section_title": "Did you know?", "section_depth": 1, "word_count": 20, "text_characters": 119, "pages": [5]}
{"kind": "paragraph", "text": "Batteries can cause serious harm to human health and the environment when disposed of with municipal solid waste. Many companies and retailers will take your old batteries and properly dispose of them or have them recycled.", "category": "main", "reason": "main_content", "level": 2, "section_path": ["Did you know?"], "source_tag": "p", "source_type": "", "coords": "5,84.00,453.68,388.43,16.74;5,84.00,477.68,425.12,16.74;5,84.00,501.68,423.46,16.74;5,84.00,525.68,261.71,16.74", "warnings": [], "article_id": "article_17", "source_title": "article_17", "source_tei": "data\\articles\\extracted_grobid_tei\\article_17.grobid.tei.xml", "block_index": 8, "section_title": "Did you know?", "section_depth": 1, "word_count": 36, "text_characters": 223, "pages": [5]}
