{"kind": "paragraph", "text": "Efficient dishwashers use only 3.2 gallons of water per cycle. Washing dishes by hand wastes significantly more water than an efficient dishwasher. With the right dishwasher and detergent, you can skip the rinse and scrape your dishes before loading them in the dishwasher.", "category": "main", "reason": "main_content", "level": 2, "section_path": ["Did you know?"], "source_tag": "p", "source_type": "", "coords": "7,84.00,313.73,360.67,16.74;7,84.00,337.73,417.03,16.74;7,84.00,361.73,390.67,16.74;7,84.00,385.73,422.57,16.74;7,84.00,409.73,210.06,16.74", "warnings": [], "article_id": "article_17", "source_title": "article_17", "source_tei": "data\\articles\\extracted_grobid_tei\\article_17.grobid.tei.xml", "block_index": 22, "section_title": "Did you know?", "section_depth": 1, "word_count": 44, "text_characters": 273, "pages": [7]}
